# LENZ — legacy URL redirects (throughthelenzphoto.com / lenzphotos.com, Wix)
# Generated from FULL-SITE-AUDIT.md section 4. Netlify _redirects syntax: source destination code
# Every entry here is a permanent (301) redirect. Rows not listed (old Wix system pages with no
# real content — /category/all-products, /my-addresses, /cart-page) are intentionally NOT redirected
# per the audit's recommendation and are left to 404.

# throughthelenzphoto.com and www.throughthelenzphoto.com are attached to this same Netlify site
# as domain aliases (not a separate site), which means Netlify serves this site's real content
# under those hostnames directly rather than redirecting — the automatic "redirect non-primary to
# primary" behavior only covers the apex/www pair of the SAME registered domain
# (lenzphotos.com -> www.lenzphotos.com), not a different aliased domain. These two host-scoped
# rules force every request on either legacy hostname to the canonical domain first, preserving
# the path; the unqualified rules below then handle the old-Wix-path-specific remapping as a
# second hop once the request lands on www.lenzphotos.com. Must stay first in this file so they
# win over the path-only rules for requests still arriving on the legacy hostnames.
https://throughthelenzphoto.com/*      https://www.lenzphotos.com/:splat   301!
https://www.throughthelenzphoto.com/*  https://www.lenzphotos.com/:splat   301!

/about                          /about/                          301
